flowchart TD
    A([START]) --> B[/Input month and milk readings/]
    B --> C{Month and readings valid?}
    C -- No --> D[/Show error and request correction/]
    D --> B
    C -- Yes --> E[Select regular or seasonal rate card]
    E --> F[Calculate fat and SNF steps]
    F --> G[Calculate rate per litre]
    G --> H[Calculate and round entry payment]
    H --> I{More ten-day entries?}
    I -- Yes --> B
    I -- No --> J[Add all litres and entry payments]
    J --> K{Total litres greater than 500?}
    K -- Yes --> L[Add Rs 0.50 per litre bonus]
    K -- No --> M[Bonus = Rs 0]
    L --> N[/Display ten-day total/]
    M --> N
    N --> O([END])
